  id: condition-frightened
  displayName: Frightened
  description: 'A frightened creature has disadvantage on ability checks and attack rolls while the source of its fear is within line of sight. The creature can''t willingly move closer to the source of its fear. (Approximated: only the attack-roll disadvantage is enforced, unconditionally rather than only while the source is visible; the ability-check part and the movement restriction are not modeled.)'
